* =====================================================================
* FABRICATED "VENDOR-STYLE" MODEL FILE - FOR PIPELINE DEMONSTRATION ONLY
* =====================================================================
* This file is NOT a real vendor download. It was written by hand to
* demonstrate the vendor/ -> models/ provenance workflow required by
* the EDA environment's model-management step. Its electrical
* parameters are loosely 1N4148-like but have NOT been validated
* against a real datasheet or vendor SPICE model and must never be
* used for an actual design.
*
* (A real vendor file would typically be dropped in here byte-for-byte
*  exactly as downloaded, with no modification.)
* =====================================================================
.SUBCKT D1N4148_VENDOR A K
D1 A K DIO_1N4148_VENDOR
.MODEL DIO_1N4148_VENDOR D
+ IS  = 4.352E-9
+ N   = 1.906
+ BV  = 100
+ IBV = 1E-4
+ RS  = 0.6647
+ CJO = 7.048E-13
+ VJ  = 0.869
+ M   = 0.03
+ TT  = 3.48E-9
.ENDS D1N4148_VENDOR
